      "message": "fix(post): name the Agie post \"Agie Wire EDM (AgieVision)\"\n\nThe AgieVision post served one control under the generic name \"Native\nwire EDM job files\". It is now \"Agie Wire EDM (AgieVision)\", and its\nrefusals say \"The Agie Wire EDM job requires ...\". The option group is\n\"AgieVision technology\"; the post dialog names the AgieVision job files.\n\nBoth old names (\"Agie native wire EDM\", \"Native wire EDM job files\")\nare hidden aliases in one generic table, posting::aliases; the project\nloader, option keys, SelectPost, SetSetupPost, resolve_cps and the\nmachine post check call it. A save writes the new name. The UI command\nImportAgieDrawing is now ImportInspectionDrawing. Posted job files do\nnot change; only line 2 of the 11 agie-native .refusal goldens changes.\n\nFixes #4000\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
